      "writtenOn": "2024-03-05T09:54:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "as RUST enables this, why not just enable CONFIG_RUST in our gki-defconfig?  That would be the \"correct\" fix here, and not this change from what I can tell, as CONFIG_RUST being enabled will probably cause other things to be enabled that we need in our base kernel image.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 123,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 123,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "a9c81b2fe524def5bc7b7e5aab71497b74727e8d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3b642848_33abfc3a",
        "filename": "init/Kconfig",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
